Set theoretical remark: First choose $\mathcal{T}_ H$. Then choose $\mathcal{T}_ G$ to contain $u(\mathcal{T}_ H)$ and such that every covering in $\mathcal{T}_ H$ corresponds to a covering in $\mathcal{T}_ G$. This is possible by Sets, Lemmas <a href="/tag/000U" data-tag="000U">3.10.1</a>, <a href="/tag/000V" data-tag="000V">3.10.2</a> and <a href="/tag/000X" data-tag="000X">3.11.1</a>.